@startuml
title State diagram for Green Rides

[*] --> LoginAndSelectDestination : User logs in and selects a destination

state "LoginAndSelectDestination" as InitialState
InitialState : entry / Display journey details
InitialState --> DrivingModeSelected : Activate driving mode
InitialState --> OtherOptionsSelected : Choose other options

state DrivingModeSelected
DrivingModeSelected : entry / Drive safely
DrivingModeSelected --> SelectPlaceToEat : Hungry and want to eat

state SelectPlaceToEat
SelectPlaceToEat : entry / View menu and place order if hungry
SelectPlaceToEat --> PlacedOrder : Place an order
SelectPlaceToEat --> NotHungry : Continue driving

state PlacedOrder
PlacedOrder : entry / Order placed successfully
PlacedOrder --> DrivingModeSelected : Return to driving mode

state NotHungry
NotHungry : entry / Continue driving
NotHungry --> DrivingModeSelected : Return to driving mode

state AccidentOccurred
AccidentOccurred : entry / Inform authorities and send notifications
AccidentOccurred --> EmergencyServicesNotified : Notify emergency services
EmergencyServicesNotified --> [*] : End journey

state FeedbackProvided
FeedbackProvided : entry / Provide feedback on the journey
FeedbackProvided --> [*] : End journey

InitialState --> AccidentOccurred : Accident occurs
InitialState --> FeedbackProvided : Journey completed and provide feedback

@enduml
